Third-party software bundled in builds
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Android app (android/)
  * AndroidX (core, appcompat, swiperefreshlayout) ........ Apache-2.0
  * Material Components for Android ........................ Apache-2.0
  * OkHttp / Okio .......................................... Apache-2.0
  * Markwon (core, ext-strikethrough, ext-tasklist, ext-latex,
    inline-parser, image, linkify) ......................... Apache-2.0
  * commonmark-java (via Markwon) .......................... BSD-2-Clause
  * JLaTeXMath (via markwon ext-latex, ru.noties:jlatexmath-android)
      GPL-2.0-or-later WITH Classpath-exception-2.0
      LaTeX rendering in chat messages uses JLaTeXMath. It is used unmodified as a
      separate library under the GPL "Classpath exception", which permits linking it
      into an application distributed under other terms. If you modify JLaTeXMath
      itself, those modifications fall under its GPL license.
      Source: https://github.com/opencollab/jlatexmath , https://github.com/noties/jlatexmath-android

Server (server/) — Rust crates fetched by Cargo, notably:
  * axum, tokio, hyper, serde, serde_json, toml, chrono, regex, uuid, parking_lot,
    dashmap, flate2, bytes, urlencoding, mime_guess, hmac, sha2, hex .. MIT OR Apache-2.0
  * qrcode ................................................. MIT OR Apache-2.0
  * rusqlite (MIT) with bundled SQLite (public domain)
  * zstd (MIT) / zstd C library (BSD-3-Clause)
  Run `cargo license` or `cargo about` in server/ for the complete list.

Speech-to-text (stt/, optional)
  * sherpa-onnx (k2-fsa) ................................... Apache-2.0
  * numpy .................................................. BSD-3-Clause
  * ffmpeg is invoked as an external program (LGPL/GPL, installed separately by the user)

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models (NOT included in this repository)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
stt/download-models.sh downloads the following pre-converted models from the
sherpa-onnx releases page. They are not redistributed by this project and are
governed by their own licenses — review them before use or redistribution:

  * sherpa-onnx-sense-voice-zh-en-ja-ko-yue-int8-2025-09-09
      Based on SenseVoice-Small (FunAudioLLM / Alibaba) — FunAudioLLM model license
      (https://github.com/FunAudioLLM/SenseVoice , MODEL_LICENSE), and the
      ASLP-lab WSYue-ASR fine-tune (https://huggingface.co/ASLP-lab/WSYue-ASR).
  * sherpa-onnx-streaming-paraformer-bilingual-zh-en
      Paraformer (FunASR / Alibaba DAMO) — FunASR model license
      (https://github.com/modelscope/FunASR/blob/main/MODEL_LICENSE).
  * silero_vad.onnx — Silero VAD, MIT (https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad).

