Trademarks / interoperability
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Codex, ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini and other product names are trademarks of their
respective owners. LeoAgent is an independent project and is not affiliated with
or endorsed by them. It talks to agents through the public Agent Client Protocol
(ACP) adapters you install yourself (e.g. codex-acp, claude-agent-acp).

The optional, off-by-default "desktop-sync" feature talks to the Codex desktop
app over an undocumented local IPC socket. See docs/desktop-sync.md.
